cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BasinGraph: bounded operational search-state optimization"
version: 3.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-08
license: BSD-3-Clause
type: software
abstract: "BasinGraph is a finite-budget nonconvex and scientific optimizer with a fixed-capacity archive of operational search-state representatives, a directed graph of observed transitions, and exact objective-evaluation accounting. Version 3.1.0 archives the immutable BasinGraph 2.0.0-rc1 result-bearing implementation together with the registered Track A-D/C evidence-extension source and documentation. The result-bearing candidate, frozen options and options hash are unchanged."
message: "Please cite the version-specific Zenodo software record, the associated evidence dataset, and the article."
